[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5507342667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5507342667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5507342667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSENhSw","user":{"login":"ArchieVillain","id":168238968,"node_id":"U_kgDOCgcfeA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168238968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchieVillain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchieVillain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T09:20:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T09:21:52Z","body":"The issue seems to be fundamental to the way mouse_entered/exited signals (and notifications) are handled currently. The process does not rely on standard input propagation. This is made more apparent if you modify the MRP so that no input is passed to the subviewport at all; mouse_entered/exited signals will still work.\n\nInstead, when a root viewport (i.e. the window) receives a mouse input, it unpacks its position and uses that to visually calculate hover. The position is then passed recursively to the hovered child viewport with the appropriate transformations, independently of whether the input it came from propagated at all.\n\nSending the input directly to the subviewport doesn't help because the first condition of the position unpacking-and-propagation process is checking that the viewport is not contained within a SubviewportContainer.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6220ead4fa06611918e371e6f51d7b9a3aefe53c/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L3261-L3287\n\nI'm not sure how you would solve this without changing how the whole process works, because the problem is that hovering is a \"visual\" interaction that is decoupled from the underlying tree and the way inputs propagate through it. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5507342667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5516731484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5516731484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5516731484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSNKkXA","user":{"login":"Emaxoso","id":17931693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTMxNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17931693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso","html_url":"https://github.com/Emaxoso","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T21:33:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:33:49Z","body":"I don't understand why `entered`/`exited` can't be derived directly from `InputEventMouseMotion` instead of being handled through a completely separate process.\n\nThis is a complete blocker for any visual UI effect that moves Controls.\n\nAlso this can be completely solved by adding a virtual method to `SubViewportContainer` or directly to the `SubViewport` class, something along the lines of:\n\n`_reproject_mouse_position(position: Vector2) -> Vector2`\n\nThis would allow `ViewportContainer` implementations to reproject the mouse position before hit-testing, without requiring a separate mechanism for `entered`/`exited`.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5516731484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5516957750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5516957750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5516957750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSNYYNg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T21:53:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:53:33Z","body":"I'm not certain why SubViewportContainer does things like this, but as a workaround you can just create your own SubViewportContainer.\nIt's mostly just a draw call like `draw_texture_rect(sub_viewport.get_texture(), Rect2(Vector2(), sub_viewport.get_size()), false)` and input propagation.\nIt loses some editor functionality, but the contents can be a separate scene for that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5516957750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517044955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5517044955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5517044955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSNds2w","user":{"login":"Emaxoso","id":17931693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTMxNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17931693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso","html_url":"https://github.com/Emaxoso","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T22:01:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T22:01:37Z","body":"@kitbdev Could you give me an example? I’m not seeing how this could work. Thx","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517044955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517187511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5517187511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5517187511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSNmZtw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T22:15:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T22:19:15Z","body":"Sure, here is a script:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Control\nclass_name MySubViewportContainer\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\tif get_child_count() < 1:\n\t\treturn\n\tvar sub_viewport := get_child(0) as SubViewport\n\tif sub_viewport == null:\n\t\treturn\n\tdraw_texture_rect(sub_viewport.get_texture(), Rect2(Vector2(), sub_viewport.get_size()), false)\n\nfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\n\tif what == NOTIFICATION_CHILD_ORDER_CHANGED:\n\t\tqueue_redraw()\n\nfunc _gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif get_child_count() < 1:\n\t\treturn\n\tvar sub_viewport := get_child(0) as SubViewport\n\tif sub_viewport == null:\n\t\treturn\n\n\tif !(event is InputEventMouse): return;\n\t\n\tvar event_new : InputEventMouse = event.duplicate();\n\tevent_new.position.x = sub_viewport.size.x - event_new.position.x;\n\tevent_new.global_position.x = sub_viewport.size.x - event_new.global_position.x ;\n\t\n\tif event_new is InputEventMouseMotion:\n\t\tevent_new.relative.x = sub_viewport.size.x - event_new.relative.x;\n\n\tsub_viewport.push_input(event_new, true);\n```\n\nIts adapted from your MRP script, the gui_input logic is the same. You should be able to replace the SubViewportContainer node with this in the MRP and it should work. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5517187511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530959770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5530959770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5530959770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSau_mg","user":{"login":"Emaxoso","id":17931693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTMxNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17931693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso","html_url":"https://github.com/Emaxoso","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T19:24:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T19:24:34Z","body":"Even with this workaround, the incorrect behavior remains.\n\nI don't know if I'd call it a bug, but having `entered`/`exited` behave completely independently from mouse events certainly feels like a strange design choice. Especially since there is no way at the code level to alter this behavior, making any UI effect that moves Controls effectively impossible\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75c36831-98bc-437a-9498-4eac1270bfa2\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530959770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5531912795","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5531912795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5531912795,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSbpKWw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T20:46:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T20:46:07Z","body":"Did you make it not an actual SubViewportContainer? It works for me:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcc18212-7e36-4ed4-bbbc-b4ee2ecbde72","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5531912795/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5532127129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-5532127129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":5532127129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSb2PmQ","user":{"login":"Emaxoso","id":17931693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTMxNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17931693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso","html_url":"https://github.com/Emaxoso","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emaxoso/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T21:05:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T21:05:24Z","body":"Thanks for double-checking, I missed that! With this workaround, it now works as expected.\n\nIt would still be useful to handle these cases directly in `SubViewportContainer`, though, so I feel like the issue should remain open.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5532127129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6162078324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123004#issuecomment-6162078324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123004","id":6162078324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb0nadA","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T06:07:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T06:07:37Z","body":"I have provided a solution for review in #124455 and is much simpler than what was required to partially address it in the mrp attached to this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6162078324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]